# Pipeline Artifacts
*.pdf
# ...except the two source scans. Tracked deliberately (this repo is local):
# the page-order correction lives ONLY in the corrected PDF and the gitignored
# token/image caches, so without these a clone gets corrected metadata pointing
# at an uncorrected scan - worse than either state alone. See PROJECT-STATUS.md
# "What is NOT recoverable from git".
!berlin_square_corrected.pdf
!berlin_square_original_transposed.pdf
*.png
# ...except CASE-YAD-MALACHI.md's own illustrations. Tracked deliberately, same
# reasoning as the two PDF exceptions above: this doc is meant to display for any
# reader who clones the repo, and a gitignored image can't do that - this is why
# its image references were silently broken from the start (found 2026-08-16).
!images/yad-malachi-berlin-title.png
!images/yad-malachi-berlin-klal-aleph.png
*.jpg
# Machon Yerushalayim critical-edition sample pages (added 2026-08-16) live
# here as *.jpg - reference only, for comparing their abbreviation-expansion/
# punctuation editorial choices against this pipeline's fidelity-first
# transcript. Not a scan source, never used for direct correction (see
# CLAUDE.md Success Criterion #1 - corrections come from THIS book's own
# scan, not another edition's editorial choices).
document_jsons/
document_jsons_berlin/
docai_word_boxes/
klalim_docai/
llm_klal_starts/
sefaria_export/
vlm_extractions/
scratch/
sefaria_reference_corpus/

# Junk
*.old
*.old.*
